COSIGNA MCP connector — provenance NOTICE
=========================================

This folder is a self-contained public distribution of the COSIGNA MCP connector,
prepared for the Qonto x Anthropic hackathon (qonto/skills).

Vendored verification core (`_verifycore/verify.py`, `chain.py`, `hashing.py`):
  These three stdlib-only files originate from the COSIGNA source tree. They are also
  available under the proprietary COSIGNA license; they are provided under MIT for this
  connector (relicensed by the founder, 2026-07-07). No other part of the COSIGNA source
  tree is included or implied to be MIT-licensed.

The connector never holds signing keys beyond the local session token (see README.md).
